    for (var wy = top + 22; wy < gy - shopH - 60; wy += 58) for (var k = 0; k < cols; k++) { var wx = xs + gap + k * (26 + gap), d = rrect(wx, wy, 26, 36, 3); if (rnd() < (dk ? 0.38 : 0.2)) { lit += d; halo += circ(wx + 13, wy + 18, 22); } else wins += d; }
    // shop window + door
